Polished the builder, launch page and Workflows list: theme-aware styling for dark mode, accent-coloured switches, one non-overlapping steps timeline, step actions in the card header, a step type segmented control, parameter modes (From an input, Fixed value, Expression) with a shared Jinja editor, step keys made from the step name, status pills without version numbers, a status tooltip in place of How editing works, and a searchable ServiceNow timezone list.
